{
  "info": {
    "name": "Coworking Space API - UKK 2026/2027",
    "_postman_id": "coworking-api-ukk-2026-2027",
    "description": "## Coworking Space Reservation API\n\n### Cara Penggunaan:\n1. **Jalankan folder '01. Setup'** secara berurutan dari atas ke bawah\n2. Token dan app_key akan otomatis tersimpan\n3. Setelah setup selesai, semua folder lain siap dicoba\n\n### Variables yang digunakan:\n- `base_url` → http://localhost:3000\n- `app_key` → otomatis terisi saat register maker\n- `maker_token` → otomatis terisi saat login maker\n- `admin_token` → otomatis terisi saat login admin\n- `member_token` → otomatis terisi saat login member",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "app_key", "value": "ISI_DENGAN_APP_KEY", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "maker_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "member_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "space_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "member_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "diskon_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "reservasi_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01. 🚀 Setup (Jalankan Berurutan)",
      "description": "Jalankan semua request di folder ini dari atas ke bawah. Token akan otomatis tersimpan.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Register Maker",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.status === true) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('app_key', res.data.maker.app_key);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('maker_token', res.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ app_key tersimpan:', res.data.maker.app_key);",
                  "    pm.test('Register Maker berhasil', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('❌ Gagal:', res.message);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/maker/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Budi Santoso\",\n    \"username\": \"budisantoso\",\n    \"email\": \"budi@smk.sch.id\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Daftarkan akun App Maker. app_key dan maker_token otomatis tersimpan ke variables."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Register Admin Space",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
